      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "7efd7ae542c9a0322a1c8000d81e15c2eade8f24cefe22bba309a2f645bf9d50"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Assuming that the environment and all loci act independently in determining survivorship, the probability of survival at inbreeding level f can be written as",
