    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "where $P_{e}$ is the genotype-independent probability of dying from environmental causes, and $P_{i}(f)$ is the probability of dying as a result of deleterious genes at the ith locus when the inbreeding coefficient is equal to $f$. From Table 10.1,",
