      "content": "where $q_i$ is the frequency of the deleterious allele, and $s_i$ and $(sh)_i$ are the probabilities of mortality for homozygotes and heterozygotes. If the probability of dying from any single cause is small, then the approximation $(1-x) \\simeq e^{-x}$ gives",
