    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Thus, the composite measures A and B can be estimated by regressing the natural logarithm of survivorship on the inbreeding coefficient.",
      "source_page": 291,
      "printed_page": 271,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_chapter10:p025:b14"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        57.0,
        820.0,
