        ]
      ],
      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "51d731820741fb26f3a6b7e3a17cbf690efe429377b54bfb525c2b0008e68d2b"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Practical situations often arise in which one only has data for noninbred individuals and a single class of inbred individuals. A regression is not possible in this case, but the parameters can still be estimated by",
